{"version":1,"content":"<p>張家輝、蒙嘉慧、鍾雪瑩、姜皓文、邱士縉（Stanley）和楊雅文（泰妹）合演的電影《我阿爹想旅行》，昨晚（13日）於尖沙咀舉行首映，監製張婉婷、導演黃綺琳與黃鐦亦有出席，張婉婷表示原與羅啟銳擔任聯合監製，唯羅啟銳在電影籌備期間逝世，才由她獨力撐大局。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.844172+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T05:11:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T08:37:37.659072+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416480+00:00","content_hash":"096bc724b75763c8e7b2bef5ed7c99d27056b36f570f7f587522ca6d40fbc825","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}